    "id": "dd_00058",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     21
    ],
    "text": "A component of the path prefix of the pathname in [I54]address[/I54] names an existing file that is neither a directory nor a\nsymbolic link to a directory, or the pathname in [I55]address[/I55] contains at least one non-&lt;slash&gt; character and ends with one\nor more trailing &lt;slash&gt; characters and the last pathname component names an existing file that is neither a directory nor a\nsymbolic link to a directory.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I54": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I55": {
      "open": "<i>",
